From 2649762a9c9ac3afab5a20adc9a8be6f2944f345 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marco <mpisanello@ilbisonte.net>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 15:23:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(room-assist): binary 35/5 output per zone (fork
 deviation)

Room Sensor Assist can deliver the physical min/max of the climate instead of
target+correction, reusing the upstream hysteresis phase. Per-zone flag, default
False, settable via velair.set_room_sensor_assist_output. Upstream suite unchanged:
2034 tests OK.
